  "prefLabel": "Ncr 565.02 Training Topics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 565.02 Training Topics. The training required pursuant to Ncr 565.01 shall contain, at a minimum, a review of administrative rules, state statutes, and division policies pertaining to the issuance of fire permits.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5605.02), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
